 private continueSummary(){const saved=this.savedResume??loadProgress();if(!saved)return 'No saved chapter was found.';const names=['First Bridge','Incomplete Span','Light Garden','Last Spark'];const done=saved.completed.length?saved.completed.map(level=>names[level-1]||`Chapter ${level}`).join(', '):'none yet';const record=Object.entries(saved.records).map(([key,value])=>`Ch ${key}: ${'★'.repeat(value.stars)}${'☆'.repeat(3-value.stars)} · ${value.bestStrokes} stroke${value.bestStrokes===1?'':'s'}`).join(' · ');return `Resume Chapter ${saved.currentChapter} · ${names[saved.currentChapter-1]}. Completed: ${done}.${record?' Best: '+record:''}${saved.workshopUnlocked?' Workshop remixes are unlocked.':''}`;}
